# ============================================================================
# Bluemotion org hygiene
# This Dev Edition org has the Coral Cloud sample template + Agentforce
# Standard Bots preloaded. Without these ignores a `sf project retrieve start`
# pulls down ~570 unrelated files. Everything below is "in the org but NOT
# part of the Blue Motion Consulting project."
# ============================================================================

# --- Profiles ---
# CLAUDE.md prescribes permission sets, not profile edits. Salesforce-managed
# profiles cannot be deployed back anyway.
**/profiles/**

# --- Salesforce-managed permission sets and packages ---
# sfdcInternalInt__* perm sets are managed by Salesforce internals and reject
# deploy attempts.
**/permissionsets/sfdcInternalInt__*
**/permissionsets/sfdc_aiplanner_service_permset.*
**/permissionsets/Agent_Builder_HOCs.*
**/permissionsets/Password_Never_Expires.*
**/permissionsets/Service_Presence_Status_Access.*

